#ASSERT `Does my relative's de facto partner take` `as family` `no will` `spouse and two children` EQUALS no
#ASSERT `What fraction goes to my relative's de facto partner` `as family` `no will` `de facto of 3 years and two children` EQUALS `a fraction of` 1
