-- The groups' shares, from the same worked families.
#ASSERT `How much goes to my relative's partner side` `as family` `no will` `spouse and two children` `the original sums` 1072000 EQUALS amount 672000
#ASSERT `How much goes to my relative's partner side` `as family` `no will` `spouse and two children` `the original sums` 400000 EQUALS amount 400000
#ASSERT `How much goes to my relative's issue` `as family` `no will` `spouse and two children` `the original sums` 1072000 EQUALS amount 400000
#ASSERT `How much goes to my relative's issue` `as family` `no will` `Sue in 2060` `the original sums` 900000 EQUALS amount 900000
