§§ `For the family member and the executor: the answer equals the baseline export's`

#ASSERT `How much of my relative's estate is left for the Table` `as family` 900000 250000 EQUALS amount (`How much is left for the Table` 900000 250000)
#ASSERT `Which item of the Table divides my relative's property` `as family` `no will` `spouse, both parents and a sister` EQUALS `the answer is` (`Which item of the Table applies` `spouse, both parents and a sister`)
#ASSERT `Does my relative's property pass to the Crown` `as family` `no will` `no relatives` EQUALS `yes if` (`Does the property pass to the Crown` `no relatives`)
#ASSERT `How much of my relative's property do I take` `as family` `no will` `a parent` `spouse, both parents and a sister` `the original sums` 1005000 EQUALS amount (`How much do I take` `a parent` `spouse, both parents and a sister` `the original sums` 1005000)
#ASSERT `How much of my relative's property do I take` `as family` `a partial will` `the surviving husband or wife` `spouse and two children` `hypothetical declared sums` 1072000 EQUALS amount (`How much do I take` `the surviving husband or wife` `spouse and two children` `hypothetical declared sums` 1072000)
#ASSERT `What fraction of the household chattels do I take` `as family` `no will` `the de facto partner` `separated spouse and de facto of 3 years` EQUALS `a fraction of` (`What share of the household chattels do I take` `the de facto partner` `separated spouse and de facto of 3 years`)
#ASSERT `Does my relative's de facto partner take` `as family` `no will` `de facto of 3 years and two children` EQUALS `yes if` (`Does a de facto partner take` `de facto of 3 years and two children`)
#ASSERT `What fraction goes to my relative's de facto partner` `as family` `no will` `separated spouse and de facto of 3 years` EQUALS `a fraction of` (`the de facto partner's fraction` `separated spouse and de facto of 3 years`)
